Cell["\<\
The fitted plane and sphere are shown at the reference time of crossing A.  \
Both normal arrows share the physical anchor A (DSCOVR).  Earth is drawn at \
its physical radius of 1 R_E and additionally marked with a point so that it \
remains visible on the inter-spacecraft scale.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"41cca8d6-dbfd-4378-82ce-9855b82381b7"],

